        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 kunit: add shared mock_ost local dt_object/thandle helpers",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 kunit: add shared mock_ost local dt_object/thandle helpers\n\nAdd mock_ost.ko, a KUnit helper module providing a mock local\ndt_object (as returned by dt_object_child()) with canned\ndo_xattr_get() replies and a do_declare_xattr_set() call counter,\nplus a trivial thandle (th_top == NULL) that short-circuits\nlod_sub_get_thandle(). This lets kunit tests for lod functions that\nread/declare an xattr on the next object layer run against a loaded\nlod.ko without a real OSD underneath, without each test reimplementing\nits own fake object/transaction.\n\nNo test consumes it yet; later test commits depend on mock_ost.ko.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I7465d2937b30da0b4a8ff7e2f66b04c35a9f0be9\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
